MODULE: CrashRecoversRetryNeedsFreeReservation
TARGET: CrashRecovers
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: retry refuses the reservation that its own interrupted operation still holds
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
    /\ ~running
    /\ running' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~running
    /\ operation = "none"
    /\ running' = TRUE
--- END
